WEBVTT

00:17.452 --> 00:23.174
They wanna paint us in neon light They wanna tell

00:23.254 --> 00:28.977
us how to burn tonight But you and me, we know the

00:29.077 --> 00:33.199
truth They can't buy what we built in our youth

00:35.600 --> 00:40.843
Turn off the synths, unplug the drums Look at the

00:40.983 --> 00:45.905
monsters that we have become Let's strip it down

00:46.085 --> 00:50.527
to the wooden wire And build ourselves a signal

00:50.567 --> 00:55.228
of fire Just the piano and the six-stringed

00:55.288 --> 01:02.087
strum Before the noise and the kingdom no one to

01:02.147 --> 01:06.810
tell us how the story ends just a brother and a

01:07.050 --> 01:13.654
sister in the time we spend on our own frequency

01:14.235 --> 01:14.815
just you

01:25.303 --> 01:30.548
They try to sell a manufactured dream A perfect

01:30.628 --> 01:35.773
picture on a glowing screen But all I need is

01:35.974 --> 01:40.879
sitting right here The melody is finally clear

01:41.880 --> 01:46.965
Just the piano and the six strings strung Before

01:47.025 --> 01:53.006
the noise and the kingdom No one to tell us how the

01:53.086 --> 01:58.228
story ends Just a brother and a sister in the time

01:58.308 --> 02:06.031
we spend on our own frequency Just you and me

02:08.672 --> 02:15.115
No heavy gloss No studio boss

02:17.929 --> 02:21.853
Just the music

02:21.893 --> 02:26.917
we wanted to make

02:26.957 --> 02:32.022
Just the piano and the six-string strum Before

02:32.082 --> 02:37.559
the noise and the kingdom come No one to tell us

02:37.619 --> 02:42.423
how the story ends Just a brother and a sister and

02:42.463 --> 02:49.968
the time we spend on our own frequency Just you

02:50.068 --> 02:51.009
and me Our

02:54.151 --> 02:57.394
own frequency

03:00.176 --> 03:01.657
Just you and me

03:08.660 --> 03:08.742
Hmm.

